Package: com.github.dock-lyrics
Version: 1.1.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: dde-shell (>= 2.0.0), libqt6network6, libqt6dbus6
Maintainer: song <song@deepin>
Homepage: https://github.com/Whisper-v/dock-lyrics
Description: Lyrics boat - a dock widget showing current music lyrics
 A deepin (dde-shell) dock plugin that wakes up when a MPRIS compatible
 player starts playing, then shows the current lyric line as a gentle
 marquee right on the taskbar. Lyrics are looked up in five stages:
 local .lrc files first, then the online databases of NetEase Cloud
 Music, Kugou, QQ Music and finally the open LRCLIB database.
